= Heinrich Brüning

Heinrich Brüning is a former soldier from the Great War and a member of the Reichstag. He is viewed favourably by President <span style="color: #808080;">Hindeburg</span>, and he supports austerity.

- @implementing_austerity
- @party_discipline
- @emergency_fundraising
- @snap_election
- @root: Return to main

@implementing_austerity
title: Implementing Austerity
subtitle: Can deflation save Germany from the crisis?
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0 and Chancellor == "Brüning"
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: welfare -= 1; lower_tax -= 1; workers_kpd += 3; workers_nsdap += 3; new_middle_nsdap += 1; old_middle_nsdap += 3; unemployed_nsdap += 4; unemployed_kpd += 3

We cut welfare and increase taxes. This causes even more suffering among the people, and the public is increasingly turning to the <span style="color: #700000;">**KPD**</span> and <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**NSDAP**</span>. We argue that it is a necessary measure to stabilize the economy.

@party_discipline
title: Party Discipline
subtitle: Reduce dissent across the party.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; left_dissent -= 5; labor_dissent -= 10; center_dissent -= 10; reformist_dissent -= 10; neorevisionist_dissent -= 5

We have enforced party discipline to reduce dissent across all factions.

@emergency_fundraising
title: Emergency Fundraising
view-if: difficulty < 1
subtitle: An emergency infusion of resources.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; emergency_used += 1; resources += 2; workers_spd -= 2 if emergency_used > 1; labor_dissent += 5 if emergency_used > 1; unemployed_spd -= 2 if emergency_used > 1; workers_spd -= 2 if emergency_used > 2; unemployed_spd -= 2 if emergency_used > 2; labor_dissent += 5 if emergency_used > 2; labor_dissent += 5 if emergency_used > 2

[? if emergency_used <= 1: Brüning helps pull in donations and arrange quick loans. ?][? if emergency_used > 1 and emergency_used < 3: Discontent is brewing among the [? if z_party_name != "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">Center Party</span>?][? if z_party_name == "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>?]'s rank and file due to our persistent attempts at begging for money. ?][? if emergency_used > 2: We’re really scraping the barrel now—committed members are pressured into selling their valuables, while many others leave in frustration. ?]

We have gained +2 resources.

@snap_election
title: Snap Election
subtitle: Call a snap election.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if chancellor != "Brüning" and president != "Brüning" : Brüning must be Chancellor or President. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and (chancellor == "Brüning" or president == "Brüning")
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; time_to_election = 3
call: set_next_election_time

We have called for new elections, set for [+ next_election_month : month +] [+ next_election_year +].
